---
description: Data modelling and financial calculations
alwaysApply: false
---
- Inspect current models and migrations before schema changes.
- Persist money using integer minor units or the project's established exact decimal representation.
- Keep dates and local display/time-zone handling consistent.
- Keep recurring schedules distinct from received/paid transactions where the model supports it.
- Store income category separately from the user-entered income source/name.
- Savings progress is based only on recorded contributions.
- Make month boundaries explicit and test month/year transitions.
- Use the existing migration mechanism; preserve user data.
